  "identityNote": "1.6.0 code and tests were recorded against 5ff0f0a; 8d7ec12 adds documentation/generated files only.",
  "notes": [
    "1.6.0 adds Ethereum mainnet/Sepolia, per-chain RPC and explorer-key isolation, canonical Ethereum USDT/USDC/XAUT defaults and user-selectable price providers.",
    "The selected RPC is stored per chain; a BNB node cannot become the Ethereum node after a restart.",
    "Cold EIP-1559 signing is tested with the official EIP-155 vector and chain-1 binding.",
    "Live Ethereum node, physical Android, independent rebuild, independent audit, hardware wallet, multisig and screen-reader session are NOT TESTED/NOT IMPLEMENTED."
  ],
  "problems": [
    "No independent professional audit.",
    "No independent-machine rebuild.",
    "No live Ethereum node round-trip or physical Android run.",
    "No two-device cold-signing test.",
    "No real screen-reader session.",
    "Hardware-wallet and multisig custody are not implemented.",
    "Cold path supports EIP-1559 type-2 only; hot path also supports legacy fees.",
    "Price/explorer providers still see source IP and queried public addresses."
  ],
